        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These companies also compete with us by having significantly greater research and marketing capabilities than we do and may also have products that have been approved or are in late stages of development and have collaborative arrangements in our target markets with leading companies and research institutions.",
