        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently rely, and expect to continue to rely, on third parties for the manufacture of our product candidates for preclinical studies and clinical trials, as well as for commercial manufacture if our product candidates receive marketing approval.",
